  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Teen Mothers&apos; Empowerment Project (TeenMEP} Abia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project targets advocacy to change negative policy and practices and promote quality SRHR, education, welfare, healthcare and empowerment services for 100 at-risk girls, would-be and existing teenage mothers in 10 selected communities in Abia state. In addition to contributing a Pilot Child Care Centre to serve the two nearby Umuezeagwu and Amaeke Communities, ultimately, This project will this project will return at least 10 girls to school and skill up at least 40 girls</narrative>
  </description>
